.TH tupath n 0.39.0 tclutils "Tcl Library Procedures"
.SH NAME
tupath \- Path helpers: normalize, clean, relative, commonPath, readlink.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
.nf
::tclutils::tupath::normalize path
::tclutils::tupath::clean path
::tclutils::tupath::isAbsolute path
::tclutils::tupath::components path
::tclutils::tupath::join args...
::tclutils::tupath::relative base target
::tclutils::tupath::commonPath {paths}
::tclutils::tupath::readlink path
.fi
